1
00:00:00,540 --> 00:00:03,375
Where a branch meets a header,
there is one curve.

2
00:00:03,395 --> 00:00:05,496
Get it wrong, and nothing fits.

3
00:00:06,812 --> 00:00:09,847
NEXUS FABRIC takes the
dimensions of the joint,

4
00:00:09,867 --> 00:00:12,398
and calculates both flat patterns.

5
00:00:13,938 --> 00:00:17,021
One equation gives every point on the cut.

6
00:00:18,253 --> 00:00:20,953
Then it checks its own work.
Folded back,

7
00:00:20,973 --> 00:00:23,364
the two edges must be one curve.

8
00:00:24,443 --> 00:00:27,556
Every step is recorded,
and can be replayed.

9
00:00:27,893 --> 00:00:31,288
What it cannot confirm,
it shows. The result stays:

10
00:00:31,308 --> 00:00:32,781
review required.

11
00:00:32,911 --> 00:00:36,516
The DXF is written,
read back, compared — and marked:

12
00:00:36,536 --> 00:00:37,809
not released.

13
00:00:38,321 --> 00:00:40,341
Reading drawings is planned.

14
00:00:40,386 --> 00:00:44,074
The calculation, the checks,
the record: running today.

15
00:00:44,495 --> 00:00:47,848
NEXUS FABRIC.
Engineering, reimagined.

